  <!-- ================= Cameras (added) =================
       Head: the camera bracket head_camera_bracket is fixed to the two side plates at the top of the column with 1 pivot hole + an arc-slot hole group (45 deg position, all 10 holes aligned, error < 0.02 mm); the D435 is fixed to the bracket with 2x M3.
       Wrist: the official ARX D405 camera adapter bracket is fixed with 2x M3 to the mounting ears on top of link16/link26 (x=46.9 mm face); the D405 is fixed to the inclined plate of the bracket with 2x M3, optical axis pointing forward-down 30 deg.
       *_camera_link / head_d435_link use the ROS camera body frame: x = optical axis forward, origin at the centre of the camera front panel (not the optical centre; use the calibration result for exact intrinsics/extrinsics). -->
